plan error: AnalyzerError: Unsupported pattern: OPTIONAL MATCH with an undirected hop chained onto another optional hop (e.g. `OPTIONAL MATCH (a)-[:R]-(b) OPTIONAL MATCH (b)-[:R]-(c)`, or `OPTIONAL MATCH (a)-[:R]-(b)-[:R]-(c)`) is not supported: the bidirectional expansion of the undirected hop cannot yet be expressed together with OPTIONAL semantics, and emitting a single-direction join would silently drop the reverse-direction matches. Rewrite the undirected hop with an explicit direction (`->` or `<-`), or split the query. (#589)